# Team Fund (MVP)

Admin manages Ranches Thunders fund tracker from the **Expenses** module
(`/expenses`) — Admin-only in nav and route.

## Capabilities

- View running balance, total contributed, and total expenses
- Per-player contribution totals (Admin records offline payments)
- Add expenses → balance updates immediately
- Ask for funds: Admin enters amount per player → WhatsApp group + in-app notify

## Contributions

- Admin may ask the squad for any per-player amount (**Ask for funds**)
- Sending the ask notifies the **WhatsApp group** (`whatsapp_notify_url`) and
  every member in-app
- Admin records each offline contribution on `/expenses` (credits the fund)
- No automatic contribution debiting in MVP

## Permissions

- Admin: mutate fund / expenses / asks / recorded contributions via `/expenses`
- Player: no Expenses nav; Home status rail remains Admin-only for fund balance
- Services still enforce `FUND_*` permissions
